        "text": "Kyna Lenhof worked at Easterseals Academy and was a special education teacher at Scammon Elementary School. She later worked as an executive assistant at the Chicago Academy for the Arts. She is a political fundraiser and serves as treasurer of the 40th Ward Democrats. Lenhof wants to reduce the school district’s reliance on high-interest loans. She supported a proposed $9.88 billion budget that avoided more high-interest loans and property tax increases. She advocates for more special education funding and equitable funding across schools. She also wants to ensure educators follow individualized education programs.",
